---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Weekly Buzz" current="">
  <section class="lp">
    <div class="lphero">
      <span class="lpkick">Free · Every week</span>
      <h2>The best of Austin news in your inbox every week.</h2>
      <p>One short email. What happened, why it matters to you, and one thing worth doing. Read it with your coffee and you're caught up.</p>
      <div class="lpembed"><script async src="https://eomail5.com/form/569e2080-dfb5-11f1-bcf0-09f884f440b6.js" data-form="569e2080-dfb5-11f1-bcf0-09f884f440b6"></script></div>
      <small class="lpfine">Free. No spam. Unsubscribe anytime. Local Buzz ATX will email you the Weekly Buzz. <a href="/privacy">Privacy policy</a>.</small>
    </div>
    <div class="lpgrid">
      <div><b>What happened</b><span>The few Austin stories that matter most today, in plain English.</span></div>
      <div><b>Why should I care?</b><span>One line on what each story means for your bills, commute, safety or neighborhood.</span></div>
      <div><b>OMG!</b><span>The thing Austin can't stop talking about.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lpsample">
      <div class="lplabel">Sample of what it looks like</div>
      <ol>
        <li><b>Eastern Travis County could face nearly 5 billion-gallon water shortage by 2080</b><em>If you live in eastern Travis County, a new study warns your water supply could fall short. Commissioners look at it Tuesday.</em></li>
        <li><b>Sample headline two</b><em>A one-sentence "why it matters to you" goes here.</em></li>
        <li><b>Sample headline three</b><em>A one-sentence "why it matters to you" goes here.</em></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <p class="lpback"><a href="/">Or just read today's news on the site →</a></p>
  </section>
</Layout>
